  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f424be585f9e04c79a96c8292e8b9db1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Parametro_BemEstar
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Bem-estar
  _titleEn: Wellbeing
  _category: 3
  _unlockTrigger: 1
  _summary: "O Bem-estar resume como a popula\xE7\xE3o avalia a vida na cidade. No
    jogo ele vem da m\xE9dia de Mobilidade, Sa\xFAde, Seguran\xE7a e Sustentabilidade,
    menos o adensamento, e aparece na escada de Cantril, de 0 a 10."
  _summaryEn: Wellbeing sums up how residents rate life in the city. In the game
    it comes from the average of Mobility, Health, Security and Sustainability, minus
    crowding, and is shown on the Cantril ladder, from 0 to 10.
  _realWorld: "A escada de Cantril pede que a pessoa d\xEA uma nota de 0 a 10 para
    a pr\xF3pria vida; \xE9 a pergunta usada pelo World Happiness Report para comparar
    pa\xEDses."
  _realWorldEn: The Cantril ladder asks people to rate their own life from 0 to 10;
    it is the question the World Happiness Report uses to compare countries.
  _tradeOffs: "Bem-estar n\xE3o se compra direto: ele reage ao conjunto dos servi\xE7os,
    e uma \xE1rea esquecida puxa a nota de todas as outras para baixo."
  _tradeOffsEn: 'Wellbeing cannot be bought directly: it responds to services as
    a whole, and one neglected area drags all the others down.'
  _sources:
  - Label: Cantril ladder (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cantril_ladder
  - Label: World Happiness Report
    Url: https://worldhappiness.report/
